[00:02.270]Ek ladki thi deewani si (曾经有个痴迷的女孩)
[00:04.870]Ek ladke pe woh marti thi (深深地爱着一个男孩)
[00:09.240]Nazrein jhukake, sharmake (她双目低垂，脸颊绯红)
[00:09.850]
[00:13.370]Galiyon se guzarti thi (在小路边徘徊)
[00:16.090]Chori chori chupke chupke (悄悄地 秘密地)
[00:19.640]Chithhiyaan likha karti thi (她想写下书信)
[00:22.710]Kuchh kehna tha shaayad usko (也许有话要说吧)
[00:25.190]Jaane kisse darti thi (可她又在害怕谁？)
[00:28.340]Jab milti thi mujhse (无论何时碰到我)
[00:31.000]Mujhse poochha karti thi (她都会问)
[00:33.950]Pyar kaise hota hai (爱情是什么样的？)
[00:36.470]Yeh pyar kaisa hote hai (这爱情是什么样的？)
[00:39.620]Aur main yehi kehta tha.. (而我 只能够这么说)
[00:42.950]Aankhen khuli ho ya ho band (不管你是睁着眼还是闭着)
[00:48.970]
[00:51.270]Deedar unka hota hai (你都只会见到你所爱的人)
[00:59.440]Kaise kahoon main o yaara yeh... (怎么跟你说 我的朋友)
